  "title": "ML Studio 2026.11.17.3",
  "notes": "- Piano Roll and Playlist selection now support Ctrl+Shift click and drag to toggle selected notes or clips while preserving the rest of the selection.\n- Vocal Tuning and Audio Timing share Playlist scrolling, time zoom, middle-drag panning and Ctrl+right-drag region zoom. Inline selection and custom mouse controls work consistently.\n- Added Behringer HPM1000 to the Master headphone referencer with a bundled offline listening preset.\n- Improved Mac plugin editor sizing for Audio Units, Retina CLAP editors and joined stock editors, including Plasma.\n- Browser samples can be dragged into supported third-party plugin editors on Windows and Mac. Fixed FL native slicer runtime discovery and the MIDI key used to trigger imported slices.\n\nhttps://michaellanemusic.de/ml-studio/",
